  "content": "[Intro]\n[A]  [F#m]\n[G]  [D]\n[A]  [F#m]\n[C]Wouldn't it be\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]nice if we were old-\ner Then we wouldn't\n[Bb]have to wait so long\n[Gm]And [C]wouldn't it be\n[F]nice to live toge-\nther In the kind of\n[Bb]world where we belong\n[Gm]  [C]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]You know it's gonna make it\n[Eb]that much better\n[Dm]When we can say goodnight and\n[Am]stay toge-\n[Gm]ther\n[C]Wouldn't it be\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]nice if we could wake\nup In the morning\n[Bb]when the day is new\n[Gm]And [C]after having\n[F]spent the day toge-\nther Hold each other\n[Bb]close the whole night through\n[Gm]  [C]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]Happy times together\n[Eb]we've been spending\n[Dm]I wish that every kiss was\n[Am]neverend-\n[Gm]ing\n[C]Wouldn't it be\n\n[Interlude]\n[F]nice\n\n[Bridge 1]\n[A]Maybe if we\n[Gmaj7]think and wish and hope and pray it\n[A]might come true\n[G]\n[A]Baby then there\n[Gmaj7]wouldn't be a single thing we\n[A]couldn't do\n[G]But we could be mar-\n[A]ried\n[Gmaj7]And then we'd be hap-\n[A]py\n[C]Wouldn't it be\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]nice\n\n[Bridge 2]\n[Dm]You know it seems the more we\n[Eb]talk about it\n[Dm]It only makes it worse to\n[Am]live without\n[Gm]it But lets\n[Am]talk about\n[Gm]it\n[C]Wouldn't it be\n\n[Chorus/Outro]\n[F]nice\nGood night\nmy baby\nSleep tight\nmy baby\n\n[Fade Out]\n[F]Good night\nmy baby\nSleep tight\nmy baby\nGood night\nmy baby\nSleep tight\nmy baby",
